<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<title>EduPlan AI Lesson Planner</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" rel="preconnect"/>
<link crossorigin="" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" rel="preconnect"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lexend:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/icon?family=Material+Icons" rel="stylesheet"/>
<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com?plugins=forms,container-queries"></script>
<style type="text/tailwindcss">
      :root {
        --primary-color: #1994e6;
        --primary-hover-color: #147ac2;
        --secondary-color: #f0f3f4;
        --secondary-hover-color: #e5e9eb;
        --text-primary: #111518;
        --text-secondary: #637988;
        --border-color: #dce1e5;
        --background-color: #ffffff;
      }
      body {
        font-family: "Lexend", sans-serif;
      }
      .btn {
        @apply flex items-center justify-center rounded-md h-10 px-4 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide transition-colors;
      }
      .btn-primary {
        @apply bg-[var(--primary-color)] text-white hover:bg-[var(--primary-hover-color)];
      }
      .btn-secondary {
        @apply bg-[var(--secondary-color)] text-[var(--text-primary)] hover:bg-[var(--secondary-hover-color)];
      }
      .form-input {
        @apply w-full rounded-md border-[var(--border-color)] bg-[var(--background-color)] text-base text-[var(--text-primary)] placeholder:text-[var(--text-secondary)] focus:border-[var(--primary-color)] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[var(--primary-color)];
      }
      .form-select {
        @apply form-input;
      }
      .form-textarea {
        @apply form-input;
      }
      .card {
        @apply bg-white rounded-lg border border-[var(--border-color)] p-6;
      }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-900">
<div class="flex min-h-screen flex-col">
<header class="sticky top-0 z-10 flex h-16 items-center justify-between border-b border-[var(--border-color)] bg-white px-6">
<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
<div class="text-[var(--primary-color)]">
<svg class="h-8 w-8" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-1 15.5v-4.5H8l4-6v4.5h3l-4 6z"></path>
</svg>
</div>
<h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">EduPlan</h1>
</div>
<nav class="hidden items-center gap-6 md:flex">
<a class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900" href="#">Dashboard</a>
<a class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900" href="#">My Lessons</a>
<a class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900" href="#">Resources</a>
<a class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900" href="#">Community</a>
</nav>
<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
<button class="btn btn-secondary h-10 w-10 p-0">
<span class="material-icons text-xl">notifications</span>
</button>
<div class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full bg-cover bg-center" style='background-image: url("https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuApdZwULubrY3FdJZqp0t2QiAFANO8va3daVY4CPmoDZwX87TkrWYhXNrXeI5mokiRwwkHXWXnG5V9g2XLvXsf-CgAoT_KdYK0iIu_nUsRawOlW9cKwatX8K-Z8xPO6KuSzFCxg4aXDbHw_Q0YaS7RibrMGk6SNtUoQQsMV_eFe2y91AkoUV3JS5p5HN-kW_WSPVkChLZS2CTFET4t5K21jrgctXeWtatyg_fiX9DbSVs8bRhbW7aKj-_N5khva1c7wL6diRlffUl6d");'></div>
</div>
</header>
<main class="flex-1 bg-gray-50 p-6 lg:p-8">
<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3">
<div class="lg:col-span-1">
<div class="card space-y-6">
<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Create a Lesson Plan</h2>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
<div class="col-span-2 sm:col-span-1">
<label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700" for="subject">Subject</label>
<select class="form-select mt-1" id="subject" name="subject">
<option>Mathematics</option>
<option>Science</option>
<option>History</option>
</select>
</div>
<div>
<label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700" for="grade-level">Grade Level</label>
<select class="form-select mt-1" id="grade-level" name="grade-level">
<option>5th Grade</option>
<option>6th Grade</option>
<option>7th Grade</option>
</select>
</div>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
<div class="col-span-2 sm:col-span-1">
<label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700" for="time-duration">Time Duration</label>
<select class="form-select mt-1" id="time-duration" name="time-duration">
<option>45 minutes</option>
<option>60 minutes</option>
<option>90 minutes</option>
</select>
</div>
<div>
<label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700" for="topic">Topic</label>
<input class="form-input mt-1" id="topic" name="topic" placeholder="e.g., Photosynthesis" type="text"/>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700" for="description">Describe your lesson topic...</label>
<textarea class="form-textarea mt-1" id="description" name="description" placeholder="Provide details about the core concepts, objectives, and any specific activities you have in mind." rows="5"></textarea>
</div>
<button class="btn btn-primary w-full justify-center">
<span class="material-icons mr-2">auto_awesome</span>
                Generate
              </button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-2">
<div class="card space-y-6">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">AI-Generated Lesson Plan</h2>
<button class="btn btn-secondary">
<span class="material-icons mr-2">edit</span>
                    Edit
                </button>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800">Introduction</h3>
<div class="prose max-w-none rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-4 text-gray-700">
<p>Start with an engaging question to spark curiosity. Briefly introduce the concept of photosynthesis and its importance for life on Earth. State the learning objectives for the lesson.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800">Activity</h3>
<div class="prose max-w-none rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-4 text-gray-700">
<p>Students will watch a short video explaining the process of photosynthesis. Following the video, they will work in small groups to create a diagram illustrating the key components: sunlight, water, carbon dioxide, chlorophyll, glucose, and oxygen.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800">Wrap-up</h3>
<div class="prose max-w-none rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-4 text-gray-700">
<p>Recap the main points of the lesson. Ask students to share their diagrams and explain one new thing they learned. Conclude with a quick quiz or exit ticket to assess understanding.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-gray-200 pt-6 sm:flex-row">
<div class="flex gap-2">
<button class="btn btn-primary">
<span class="material-icons mr-2">save</span>
                        Save
                    </button>
<button class="btn btn-secondary">
<span class="material-icons mr-2">picture_as_pdf</span>
                        Export PDF
                    </button>
</div>
<button class="btn btn-secondary">
<span class="material-icons mr-2">school</span>
                    Export to Classroom
                </button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</main>
</div>

</body></html>
